contentText:
LL Cool J added to the enigmatic lore of Ol&#8217; Dirty Bastard when recalling a time that ODB urinated on his plaques at a New York City studio.

LL joined SiriusXM&#8217;s Salute the Sample on Thursday (July 8), where he recounted getting one of the more bizarre phone calls in his life, which found the late Wu-Tang Clan rapper in a rage.

